# Kang, Suspicious Captain: "Whenever one or more goaded creatures attack" triggers once for the batch, however many goaded
# creatures attack (CR 603.2c). Koloth, Tribble Hunter goads every Tribble (CR 701.15a), so Bot1's two Tribbles, made at
# its turn-1 end step, must attack on turn 3 (CR 701.15b), together: Kang's ability triggers once and puts one +1/+1
# counter on Kang, not one for each attacker.

